> Same prior codes across all supplied classes

Each class row uses exactly the same five standard-normal two-coordinate codes, seed2143.
Rows0–9 change only the supplied decoder class. There is no image or posterior input and no
learned class-specific prior. All fifty sigmoid decoder probabilities are shown; none is
selected for quality or rescaled per image.

