> A fixed two-dimensional latent grid for class3

The complete81-point grid holds class3 fixed, varies z_x from−2 to2 left to right and z_y
from2 to−2 top to bottom, step0.5. It is a decoder inspection, not a plot of learned data
coordinates or evidence of semantic axis separation. The shared fixed gray range makes weak
and saturated outputs visible.

